n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-c422087\" data-eae-slider=\"6748\" data-id=\"c422087\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-87d7242 elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"87d7242\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"></div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-dc50121 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-eae-slider=\"61551\" data-id=\"dc50121\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-7ac7734\" data-eae-slider=\"42669\" data-id=\"7ac7734\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-27928d3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"27928d3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">What to Expect from a Contested Divorce in Lakewood</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ae35a87 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ae35a87\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">When pursuing a contested divorce, it is important to understand the process and what to expect. Here are key aspects to consider:</span></p><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Issues Tackled: A contested divorce typically addresses multiple issues, including </span><a href=\"https://thedrakelawfirm.com/family-law/child-custody/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">child custody</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, visitation schedules, </span><a href=\"https://thedrakelawfirm.com/family-law/child-support/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">child support</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, spousal support, </span><a href=\"https://thedrakelawfirm.com/family-law/divorce/property-division/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">division of property</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, and debt allocation.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Factors Considered: During the proceedings, the court considers various factors, such as the best interests of the children involved, the financial circumstances of both parties, contributions made during the marriage, and other relevant factors that impact the division of assets and determination of support.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Presenting in Court: In a contested divorce, each party presents their case, including evidence, witnesses, and legal arguments, to support their position on the disputed matters. The court carefully considers these presentations in making final decisions.</span></li></ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-babb087 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"babb087\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Why You Need an Experienced Contested Divorce Attorney in Lakewood</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e208ad1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"e208ad1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">A contested divorce requires skilled legal representation to protect your rights and achieve a favorable outcome. Engaging the services of an </span><a href=\"https://thedrakelawfirm.com/family-law/divorce/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">experienced contested divorce attorney</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> is crucial for several reasons:</span></p><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Legal Knowledge: An attorney well-versed in family law and contested divorce proceedings will have a deep understanding of the laws, rules, and processes specific to Lakewood, CO. They can navigate the complexities of your case and provide accurate guidance tailored to your unique situation.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Strategic Guidance: Your attorney will develop a comprehensive strategy to present your case effectively. They will work closely with you to gather evidence, analyze the facts, and craft persuasive arguments in support of your desired outcomes.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Negotiation and Representation: Your attorney will skillfully negotiate on your behalf, striving to reach a fair settlement outside of court whenever possible. However, if litigation becomes necessary, they will assertively advocate for your rights and present your case persuasively in court.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Emotional Support: Going through a contested divorce can be emotionally challenging. A compassionate contested divorce attorney will provide you with support, empathy, and guidance throughout the process, ensuring you feel heard and understood.</span></li></ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-43d47a5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"43d47a5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Don't get pushed around – Contact Us Today</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3729cba elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"3729cba\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If you are facing a contested divorce in Lakewood, CO, The Drake Law Firm is here to offer reliable legal support and guide you toward a favorable resolution. Our experienced attorneys will work tirelessly to protect your interests, advocate for your rights, and help you navigate the complexities of the process. Contact us today to </span><a href=\"https://thedrakelawfirm.com/contact-us/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">schedule a consultation</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> and take the first step toward a brighter future.</span></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-43d3da0 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-eae-slider=\"62813\" data-id=\"43d3da0\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-64f6b63\" data-eae-slider=\"36558\" data-id=\"64f6b63\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-babfa8b elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"babfa8b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"></div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t"
